  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1904.03 Proposed Protected Instream Flow Study Report",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1904.03 Proposed Protected Instream Flow Study Report. The department shall prepare a proposed protected instream flow study report that includes:\n\n(a) The recommended, scientifically-based, protected instream flows;\n\n(b) The methods applied to determine the protected instream flows; and\n\n(c) The supporting information used to determine those flows.\n\nSource. #12695, eff 12-22-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1900.html"
}
